<description>&lt;p&gt;Government forces are massing near opposition leaders' homes while Kenya launches major operations against al-Shabaab in Mandera and Garissa, extending combat beyond Somalia. Somalia imposed financial sanctions on a former regional leader and nine others for alleged al-Shabaab links, and it is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case. The United States is shifting drones from Somalia to the Latin America drug war, and Egypt will host talks with Eritrea, Sudan and Somalia as Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions rise. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQMXEzQkZkeU1HQmlsNzFDUUhDbnVmbngtbVZGd2tZNGhjaUtzWEZqQ0pvSTF4bW16ZjljbWU2YlBkdl9OVFFJRE5xVXJoVXZCZGI4cl9ubDdrNnlpUXBiUUJLOVdKZ1hRbG52RjAyYWY2VTByS0V5a3BuYzM0dDNpZ0ViT2pNcEZ4dW1ITmFoajNwaW9zNWZLTkxQM3JRcHRwbVdGNXo0cWVEMmZsdk9jdk1xSk9xX1hqS25VTFl2QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNODRacDIweFlsNFdaY2VySjhHTVpYald2bzFwMGluQWwyYzBRTXE2c2FMaG13Z29ROXpQdFd6eThnVk5XTmJCNmt3R3BUeFJhbktLX3pKb2R3RkNsbU4xanNuc1Z4TXhZOXpMUVNhc0oyVDBJMzVhNXN5ZlVwN1FYbmFoYWlCbGJPWG5Ec0h3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOcXdJeDgzMFBMd05vTXFZWEpIZk1jcEZucTRHbTNfemZrdTBvSkFmMG1leGN0Y3FsTE1NWFF4ZHZpZ2FzTHpUaDh4ajBBN2RWYXlyYzM5RDVUODJjUHlwNFNsdnMtTnVHTDNRM0xYX3ExY0k1YkNfY0pZVHktYmt5eU5OVF82eW0xWmtqT2ZHVkV4Vm9FNndqVGF2Nm1mS3V0UjE2MFpjbHFwRTN3NENSenJidGRQTW5p?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPSnJVLTRnNHp5RHVKaEU1QUFZajQya2p5Vjc4SFJoWVhpNXJnaEdlOFQ1UXhVM1JwS0VsdWRrUmdpYXF6NWFmNm5hZVllY1BQN3cwMXpfUDUyOGRPeDhTVm9Qa0pNaUhHNmtUa21IdEpkOVZNR2RHaVJXNTNkS